{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And they shall keep his charge.</b> Every duty that a person is appointed over and obligated to perform is called מִשְׁמֶרֶת throughout Scripture and in the language of the Mishnah — as is said of Bigtan and Teresh: ״וַהֲלֹא אֵין מִשְׁמַרְתִּי וּמִשְׁמַרְתְּךָ שָׁוָה״ (Megillah 13). So too the watches of priesthood and Levitical service."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:11.668596726Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}